    "turn_text": "program. Well, thanks for being here. Certainly appreciate you being part of the panel this morning. You know, we heard a lot about your history, but before we get there, let's kind of want to look the listeners know who you are, the guy that was playing hockey down in Pennsylvania. How did you get to be coming to Congress?",
