    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/9/6/96370.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 23,
    "turn_text": "So Patrick, we really appreciate your time. One question before you go. In terms of predictions, we're now in the new decade, looking 2020 and beyond. Where do you think the cyberspace is going to go over the next decade?",
